# Task 144-010 Plan: Dockerfile Hardening

## Objective
Multi-stage build, non-root user (deckent, UID 10001), HEALTHCHECK, tight .dockerignore, image <400MB.

## Files to Modify
1. `Dockerfile` — multi-stage build (builder + runtime), USER deckent (UID 10001), HEALTHCHECK
2. `.dockerignore` — tighten exclusions
3. `tests/docker/dockerfile.test.ts` — update existing tests + add 5+ new hardening tests

## Approach

### Dockerfile (multi-stage)
- Stage 1 `builder`: node:22-slim, install ALL deps, copy source, run `tsc` build
- Stage 2 `runtime`: node:22-slim, install only runtime system packages (tmux, git), copy dist + prod node_modules
- Create `deckent` user (UID 10001, GID 10001) in runtime stage
- HEALTHCHECK: test with `node /app/dist/cli/entry.js --version` (no external curl dependency)
- WORKDIR /workspace, ENTRYPOINT

### .dockerignore
- Add: `*.md` files (except package.json area), `src/`, `scripts/`, `**/*.test.ts`, `.github/`, coverage dirs

### Tests
- Update `single-stage build` test → assert multi-stage (2 FROM lines)
- Add: non-root USER test
- Add: HEALTHCHECK directive test
- Add: multi-stage FROM count test
- Add: .dockerignore exists + excludes key dirs test
- Add: production node_modules omit-dev test
